                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]Follow my Steam Curator page for more reviews https://store.steampowered.com/curator/35705466[/b]\nMonsters! is an adequately priced twin stick shooter from which I would have loved to see more. Unfortunately, I am a noob and I can't get pass the 4th level and you have to start from the beginning if you die. Despite being a very simple game, it offers a large variety of monsters, a few abilities and a single pool for your ammo (if it reaches 0 you can still shoot but upon contact with a monster you instantly die) and health which forces you to constantly move and collect souls in order to refill it.\nMy only complaint is the lack of level selection.",
